[en.CHARACTER_SUNSET_SHIMMER_NAME]
Sunset Shimmer

[en.CHARACTER_SUNSET_SHIMMER_DESC]
Shortly after the signing of the Declaration of New Ponyville, Sunset Shimmer was elected as the interim Prime Minister of Free Equestria. It is not an appointment too surprising: Sunset Shimmer is both a capable person and the reconciler of multiple factions within Free Equestria. Everyone is satisfied — except Sunset herself.

Due to the asynchrony of time between the two worlds, Sunset Shimmer can shuttle between the two worlds, handling the most important affairs without missing too much. She has to take care of her own daily life as an ordinary highschool girl in Canterlot City — studying, working, and socializing. She also has to serve as the interim Prime Minister of Free Equestria — attending meetings, reviewing reports, and governing the country. Her life now is brutally divided into two completely different parts by a mirror portal, which now you can clearly tell is exhausting her.
Sunset has considered staying in Equestria, but she can’t bear to leave her friends and the life on the other side. Meanwhile, abandoning Equestria — her hometown — is even more unacceptable to her. Fortunately, her friends, though having different opinions on Sunset’s actions in the other world, are still willing to provide as much support as possible to Sunset, which she is very grateful for. She believes that the friendship between them is unbreakable, indestructible, and capable of overcoming all difficulties. But this also makes Sunset more worried — if something goes wrong in Equestria, her friends may be dragged into trouble because of her. She is worried that her actions may somehow cause harm to her friends who have done nothing wrong.

At the same time, Sunset is also entangled and doubtful about her identity: who is she? Who should she be for the rest of her life? Canterlot City has her friends and the scenery she loves. Equestria is her hometown, and the creatures under the dark rule of the “Big Three” are looking up to her as if she is their savior. Perhaps when the day of victory comes, and Equestria is restored, she can finally lay down those responsibilities and return to the simple and ordinary life she desires.

§RThe only question is, can she really get what she wants?§!

[zh.CHARACTER_SUNSET_SHIMMER_NAME]
余晖烁烁

[zh.CHARACTER_SUNSET_SHIMMER_DESC]
自《纽伯尼维尔宣言》签订后不久，余晖烁烁便被选举为自由小马利亚的临时总理。这似乎理所应当：余晖烁烁有能力，同时各方各派的矛盾也因余晖烁烁而得以调和。所有人都很满意 —— 除了余晖自己。

得益于两个世界的时间不同步，余晖烁烁可以较为从容地在两个世界之间穿梭而不错过太多重要事务。她既要照顾自己在坎特拉市作为一名普通女孩的日常生活——读书学习，打工赚钱，日常社交。又要担任自由小马利亚的临时总理一职——参加会议，批阅报告，管理国家。她的生活就这么被一道传送门分割成两个截然不同的两部分，而这显而易见令她疲惫不堪。
余晖考虑过一直呆在小马利亚，但她舍不得自己的朋友与另一边的生活。而弃小马利亚——她的家乡——于不顾则更令她难以接受。好在，她的朋友们虽然对余晖在另一个世界的所作所为都各有看法，但还是愿意对余晖烁烁提供尽可能多的支持，余晖烁烁对此十分感激。她相信她们之间的友谊牢不可破，坚不可摧，足以战胜一切困难。但这也让余晖烁烁更加担心——一旦小马利亚出了什么意外，那么自己的朋友们可能因为自己遭遇无妄之灾。她担心自己的行为可能会牵连到自己无辜的朋友们。

与此同时，余晖烁烁也纠结和怀疑起自己的归属：自己究竟是谁？自己究竟该以什么身份来度过自己接下来的时光？坎特拉市有自己的朋友，有自己热爱的风景。而小马利亚是自己的故乡，那些处于三巨头黑暗统治下的生灵们正盼望着她去拯救。或许在胜利的那天到来，小马利亚恢复正常的时候。自己也就能卸下那些责任，回归到自己所希望的简单而平凡的生活里去。

§R但，自己真的能如愿以偿吗？§!
